# The sha256 of each InRelease file that the INDI images install from,
# by its name under /var/lib/apt/lists: three suites of Ubuntu and one
# suite of each PPA, all at one snapshot date. snapshot.sh checks them
# after apt-get update, and latest.sh --bump writes them. The names
# carry the date, so a date with no lines here fails the build.
